  unitName: Great Tree Alneu
  unitId: 30112
  unitNumber: 141
  description: A giant tree with a will of its own and the ability to move. It can
    also speak, but since it gets its nutrition from photosynthesis, it's still biologically
    classified as a plant. Alneu's fruit contains a stimulant that can heal fatigue,
    and it often gives it to humans it likes. Contrary to its large size it likes
    small and cute things, especially human children.
  summonDesc: Why do you seek me, little one?<br>I will make sure your wish<br>comes
    true.
  fusionDesc: If I were to use human words,<br>I guess I'd say that felt good.
